msgid ""
"Kasallik muddatida (birinchi va oxirgi sutka ham ichida) kursant naryadga "
"qo‘yilmaydi. Muddat tugagach oddiy navbatga qaytadi; o‘tkazib yuborilgan "
"navbatlar qarz bo‘lib yig‘ilmaydi."
msgstr ""
"During the illness period (first and last duty day included) the cadet is "
"not assigned. Afterwards they return to the normal rotation; missed turns do "
"not pile up as debt."

