"naryadga chiqmaydigan lavozimdagilar — kurs starshinasi, guruh komandirlari, "
"kurs pisari, kaptyorchik — kirmaydi)."
msgstr ""
"Based on total duties: green — difference (max − min) ≤ 1, yellow — 2, red — "
"3 or more. Only cadets on the duty roster are counted (inactive cadets and "
"those in positions — course senior cadet, group commanders, course clerk, "
"storekeeper — are excluded)."

