msgstr "Active, excluding those in positions (not on the duty roster)"

msgid "1 o‘g‘ilga o‘rtacha naryad"
msgstr "Average duties per male cadet"

msgid ""
"Aylanish to‘g‘ri ishlasa, har guruh har joyni deyarli teng marta beradi. Joy "
"guruhga biriktiriladi, shuning uchun <b>kursanti kam guruhda bir o‘g‘ilga "
"ko‘proq naryad to‘g‘ri keladi</b> — bu qabul qilingan qoida (adolat guruh "
"ichida o‘lchanadi, CLAUDE.md 4-B.5)."
msgstr ""
"When rotation works correctly, each group covers each post an almost equal "
"number of times. Posts are assigned to groups, so <b>in groups with fewer "
"cadets each male cadet gets more duties</b> — this is the accepted rule "
"(fairness is measured within a group, CLAUDE.md 4-B.5)."

msgid ""
"O‘rtacha faqat naryadga chiqadigan o‘g‘il bolalar soniga bo‘linadi (naryadga "
"chiqmaydigan komandirlar va kurs lavozimlari kirmaydi)."
msgstr ""
"The average is divided only by the number of male cadets on the duty roster "
"(commanders and course positions are excluded)."

msgid "Qo‘lda tuzatishlar nazorati"
msgstr "Manual corrections review"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Tasdiqlangan sutkalardagi almashtirishlar (sutka qayta tuzilganda yo‘qolgan "
"tuzatishlar sanalmaydi). Jami: <b>%(total)s</b>."
msgstr ""
"Replacements on approved duty days (corrections lost when a duty day is "
"regenerated are not counted). Total: <b>%(total)s</b>."

msgid "Diqqat: qo‘lda qo‘yilishi guruh o‘rtachasidan sezilarli ko‘p"
msgstr "Attention: manual assignments significantly above the group average"

#, python-format
msgid "qo‘lda %(n)s marta qo‘yilgan, hovuz o‘rtachasi %(mean)s"
